  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC14_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So this is what they call negotiation in Polaris? I will remember this the next time they look to set the price of olives in Valencia.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_Prince_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Principe_Mario_di_Mario_NV-PUERT_030.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562164,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC14_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Meanwhile my celebrations are ruined. The Monquistans refused my invitation to the sad Pingouin party. I thought we were such good friends...",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_Prince_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Principe_Mario_di_Mario_NV-PUERT_031.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562164,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC14_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Our supposed allies must be up to something. Luckily, we have a Spy in their midst. No, that is not suspicious, not suspicious at all!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_Prince_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Principe_Mario_di_Mario_NV-PUERT_032.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562164,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC14_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If the Monquistans have nothing to hide, why should they be afraid of spies? Go to the Jungles - she will reach out to you. Find out what she knows.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_Prince_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Principe_Mario_di_Mario_NV-PUERT_033.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562164,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC20_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I'm very glad you've come. A lot has been happening, but it is now too dangerous to report back in.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_SpyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Valencian_Spy_NV-PUERT_002.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562170,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC20_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "As you can see, the Monquistans have cut down the banana trees.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_SpyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Valencian_Spy_NV-PUERT_003.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562170,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC20_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They have taken the fruit and wood to that large structure over there. Go investigate - I will make my way there very slowly. Like a tree.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_SpyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Valencian_Spy_NV-PUERT_004.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562170,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC20_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "No, don't look at me! Remember, I am only a tree. The banana trees - they grew back in an instant! I have never seen the like!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_SpyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Valencian_Spy_NV-PUERT_005.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562170,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC20_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The priest over there - the trees grew back after he led some Monquistans in prayer. Perhaps he knows what is going on.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_SpyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Valencian_Spy_NV-PUERT_006.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562170,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC20_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I cannot talk to him. Because I am only a tree.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_SpyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Valencian_Spy_NV-PUERT_007.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562170,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Wizard! It is good to see you again. I must thank you, in the name of Don Manzana, King Gortez, and the Sacred Tree. You have shown us the way!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Priest_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Monsignor_Del_Monte_NV-PUERT_019.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562148,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Your tale of the Pingouins and their fish opened my eyes. I wondered if we could do the same. We can! This land is a gift from the Supreme Primate!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Priest_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Monsignor_Del_Monte_NV-PUERT_020.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562148,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "We can cut down all the trees and harvest the fruit and lumber, for they simply regrow.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Priest_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Monsignor_Del_Monte_NV-PUERT_021.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562148,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "As Saint Capuchin wrote: \"Look ye to the Blessed Ones, who shall lead the children of the Supreme Primate to the Grove of Good and Plenty.\" That's you!",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Priest_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Monsignor_Del_Monte_NV-PUERT_022.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562148,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It was Dasein who spoke to you, not the Supreme Primate. But perhaps this Dasein is but an instrument of the divine, and you are Dasein's chosen.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Priest_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Monsignor_Del_Monte_NV-PUERT_023.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562148,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC01_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I have sent a legate to the Grand Pooh Bah, and expect the question of your sainthood to be resolved within a week. Your humanity is forgiven.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Monkey_Priest_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Monsignor_Del_Monte_NV-PUERT_024.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562148,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC20_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It is worse than I thought - the Monquistans have an unlimited supply of bananas and lumber. Things they once bought from us.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_SpyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Valencian_Spy_NV-PUERT_008.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562170,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC20_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Principe Mario must learn of this. Tell him at once. I would go myself, but I am only a tree. Trees move very slowly.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_SpyF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Valencian_Spy_NV-PUERT_009.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562170,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "NV-PUERT-NPC14_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Monquistans are doing WHAT?!? The fruit market, it will be destroyed! What next?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Unicorn_Prince_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Principe_Mario_di_Mario_NV-PUERT_034.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1562164,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
